Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:39.88,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(962,922)}Earth Defense Force Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:42.78,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Gatlantis has been noticeably more active in the last few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:47.53,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Pluto, Neptune, the Asteroid Belt…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.53,0:01:53.77,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,They appeared in various locations in the Solar System, engaged in battle, and withdrew temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:56.81,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{korewa}Those must be diversions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:02:02.13,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,They're preparing for a\N large-scale assault on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:03.39,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,To confirm…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:07.05,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,An object the size of Jupiter can warp ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.55,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,When will it reach the Solar System ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:10.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Any chance of negotiation with them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:13.39,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Their objective is destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:19.98,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,It's apparent from the statements of the 11th planet\N civilians currently being held in isolation on the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:27.13,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Gatlantis has no concept of expanding its\N supremacy by conquering other civilizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:30.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,If so…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:33.61,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,War is unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:40.92,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,The factory in the time fault is operating at full capacity, but our forces are still inadequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:47.52,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Further collaboration between public and private sectors is necessary to strengthen our forces. {TEXT: Earth Defense Force Reinforcement Unit}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:48.28,Karaoke Translation op,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(964,926)}Earth Defense Force Reinforcement Unit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:53.66,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{naigai}The wave motion gun fleet has drawn\N criticism from both inside and outside, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:56.25,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{sono}…its value will be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.31,0:03:03.87,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,In the war against Garmillas,\N we nearly went extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:06.59,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Not this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:11.80,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{mou}We don't have time. We must act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:14.95,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Otherwise mankind will…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:19.04,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Power to the CR booster system is confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:23.44,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Got it. We'll combine it with the\Nwave motion core booster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:27.35,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The key to the survival of the human race…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:34.36,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,We must complete it before those bastards arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:39.45,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:44.35,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Here it comes. \NIt's the data transmission from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:50.70,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Send it to the analyst immediately. \NHQ must be tracking the White Comet's movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:51.71,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:56.48,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll be able to talk to\N them in real time in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:00.78,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Relay all the family messages to the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:02.11,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.68,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Good. It stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.92,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Captain, I'll go check the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.40,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We're really pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:23.37,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp should be limited to three times\N a day, but that was the fifth one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:29.58,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,On top of that, the wave motion engine has\N anti-wave motion photon "bacteria" inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:38.76,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Keyman helped us, \Nbut it wasn't so easy to remove…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:40.76,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Where's Keyman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:45.21,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,In a confinement cell. \NHe returned to it himself afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:59.51,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Consecutive warps are hard on the injured, aren't they{isn't it} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:05.98,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,You should go to sickbay, \Nbut you came back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:07.54,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:12.73,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I'm a traitor.{betrayer.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:17.17,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,You betrayed Desler, didn't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.97,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Why didn't you go with him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:23.53,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I know about Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:31.18,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,He has the strength to ignore\N the human side of mankind, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:37.88,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{hitsuyo}It's the strength of killing one's self or others \Nwithout hesitation when deemed necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.21,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,That side of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:46.20,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,For a moment, I heard my mother's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.64,0:05:52.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I hadn't {had a }dreamed of her for so long.{ many years.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:57.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,But my mother didn't appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:06:00.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Instead, it was the Yamato's Yamamoto Akira.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:02.76,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Disappointed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:04.68,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:09.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I was glad for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:13.61,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,It might be fate as Teresa would put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.39,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Fate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.77,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Apparently, that's the connection between people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Ties, love, whatever you call it…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:27.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{ore}…I feel like I've found it on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:37.46,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,That's very human. \NSo irresponsible and selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:42.49,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Love is the beginning of tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:07:01.64,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Tsubasa, your dad's job on\N the Yamato will be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.59,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,He's coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:09.35,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,You should ask him to\N carry you on his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:15.63,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,He'll be surprised and say, "You grew so fast."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.98,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,He's only two years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:42.29,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:16.05,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Because Nol also died in battle, we hastily materialized Gorland's succession clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:22.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We're about to hand him over to Zaizen, \Nthe former Gorland, according to the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.27,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why are they smiling ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:25.96,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sir ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.88,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,It's just a mechanical procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:34.14,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why do they look like they're smiling ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:36.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:38.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:45.08,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It seems to happen when we\N see a life just being created.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.52,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{toki}Sometimes tears come down for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:02.36,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Apparently, Planet Telezart disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:07.66,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Earth was the target of Teresa's cosmo wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:11.87,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,But now that Telezart is gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:15.39,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,It's only invisible to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.68,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Teresa is watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:22.23,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We'll invade Earth as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:23.91,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,To do that…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:28.90,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,I'll arrange a new Silver Priestess as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.48,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Sabera is different from us Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:48.85,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Gatlantis was created by Zemulian. \NShe's a pure copy of one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:56.18,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Unlike us clones, she doesn't \Nrequire a lengthy growth cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.10,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,She's very efficient, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:07.79,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,…we need this size of memory device in order to re-create the body and soul of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:11.56,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,She's the Silver Maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:17.56,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Only the last human is allowed to have such a luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:21.83,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You said, as I wished, correct ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:25.03,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Yes, in addition to the memory cap…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:31.06,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,No issue with the suppression of emotions and\N synchronization to the control device, I presume ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:33.06,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,It's thoroughly prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:45.83,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,A doll, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:54.28,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,She shouldn't resonate with the \NSabera being held captive on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:59.47,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,No suffering, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:12.88,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Garmillas has kept the policy of expanding its colonies for a long time, and it's undergoing a drastic change due to democratization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.15,0:11:22.44,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}However, our nation has a group of people who tried to turn the clock backward for autocracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:30.67,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The Garmillas National Security Police \Nhereby announces the {capturing}arrest of all traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:39.24,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,Do you understand the meaning of arresting me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:42.49,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,Only the Desler regime guarantees our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:43.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:46.12,def2,GIMLAY,0,0,0,,At this rate, Garmillas will be destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:46.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:52.26,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Prioritizing democratization before\N dealing with the greater issue…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:56.90,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,The path for your return to Garmillas is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.09,0:12:04.63,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We can help you reclaim your authority if you wish…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:07.27,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{jouken}…with one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.27,0:12:08.73,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,How dare you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:12.78,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I do not wish to become a puppet of Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:16.39,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,But you can save the decaying Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:24.23,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You're pragmatic, \Nand different from your nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:27.87,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.38,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Here's the condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.18,0:12:38.78,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Destroy the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:44.08,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Transit wave motion gun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:49.28,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Using the anti-wave motion photons as a booster, and mixing it with the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:52.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,If we can't remove it,\N perhaps we can burn it completely ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:54.92,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,What would happen then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:13:01.64,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We can only use it once, but the energy released will be drastically increased…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:05.46,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{osoraku}…exponentially, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:08.68,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Any risks ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.13,0:13:11.63,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:17.25,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,But I already have a solid idea of the\N principle and mathematical formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:23.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The scar left by Keyman's betrayal\N will become tremendous strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.43,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Could that be the power of fate\N Teresa was talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,That's too convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:37.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I know, but the transit wave motion gun may\N be our trump card to defeat the White Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:45.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada, you questioned why Gatlantis' Zorder wanted to obtain Teresa's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.63,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.63,0:13:53.83,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's just a hypothesis, but Teresa is a lifeform\N who resides in a higher dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:57.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{konoyo}She sees through time from the beginning to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:14:05.94,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{wareware}If she descends into our universe, it might lose its variable nature and become rigid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.41,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:10.59,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,So, in other words…?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:13.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What's important is the phenomena, not theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:21.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What if our dimension loses the meaning of existence \Ndue to the intervention of a higher dimensional lifeform ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.87,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,End of the universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:30.12,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,But we met Teresa in person. That didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:34.82,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We only saw her world through the Teresarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:39.35,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Our enemy's objective is…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:43.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,…to exterminate all lifeforms including themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:47.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's what Zorder wants. {TEXT: Saturn}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:49.23,Karaoke Translation op,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(970,924)}Saturn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:57.83,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(964,1032)}Enceladus Defense Unit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:20.27,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,More than one hundred \NCalaklum class ships, and increasing !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:22.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The moment of truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Incoming message from Enceladus Defense Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:26.68,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Patch it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:31.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is the Enceladus Defense Unit. \NCommand HQ, do you copy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:36.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Increasingly large number of enemy ships detected in Saturn's orbit. Requesting immediate reinforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:41.49,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{kurikaesu}I repeat. Number of enemy ships increasing. Requesting immediate reinforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:46.84,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Communications lost. \NAppears to be caused by the enemy ships' warp out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:52.78,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Breaking through the center by taking \Nadvantage of their overwhelming fleet size...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:56.27,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{ginga}It's just as Ginga's AI predicted…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:16:00.17,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All carrier-borne aircraft have been \Nreplaced with the Cosmo Tiger II.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:04.88,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,No change of plans !\N All ships, prepare to warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:07.03,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare to warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:13.08,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The Earth Federation has decided\N to engage in war with Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:18.73,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Today's Earth Force is much better equipped than during the war against Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:26.17,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}They will protect Earth citizens' lives, \Nproperties, and lands for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:30.24,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,That's what the wave motion gun fleet is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:46.15,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We can only depend on them for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:54.32,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The transit wave motion gun might be able to \Nblow away the White Comet's high pressure gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:57.73,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:36.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,More and more warp outs !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:43.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Nazca class, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:56.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Unknown ship detected !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:57.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Put it on the main panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:02.89,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Look at the size…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:06.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That's their flagship ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.50,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All aerial units, dive now !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:45.08,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Prepare to launch the Eaters.\N Turn the catapult.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:01.72,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,A number of small combat ships have been deployed by the large enemy battleship !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:03.14,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Small ships incoming !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:04.20,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Shoot them down !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:12.39,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Ship Eight's wave motion shield's been breached !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.39,0:19:13.09,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:36.68,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,E23's destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.35,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,How many are left ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:40.94,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Six Kongo-class and eight escorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:44.84,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Intel says, many Calaklum class ships \Nare approaching from above !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:45.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.47,0:19:59.13,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Calaklum ships destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:02.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamanami ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:14.23,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,You think you can win \Nwith only that many ships ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:15.68,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Charge !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:18.49,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,What a fool for being so overconfident in sheer power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:22.74,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{chikara}You should know that power can be\N overwhelmed by an even greater power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:36.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Lord Balsey, new enemy fleets appeared in the direction of Dagma, Bomie, and Zeven !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.75,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's twice as large as before !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:43.98,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Where did Earth hide that many fleets…?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:51.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Balsey, a standstill in battle is unacceptable.\N You do know that, don't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:52.58,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Your Majesty ! {Can be omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:01.41,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,It looks like I can have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:06.87,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Great Emperor…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:14.78,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Two more warps, and we'll be on the battlefield !\N Make sure you're fully prepared !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:15.99,def2,MEN,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.58,0:21:28.28,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}"There's a way to save your son."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:32.68,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}"Ask Katsuragi Touko for details."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:01.53,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Take Inferno Canone formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.44,0:22:37.62,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Welcome…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:40.79,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,…to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:45.92,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 17
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:45.92,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(504,1040)}Battle of Saturn - Gather the Wave Motion Gun Fleet !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:23:00.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1214,712)}Kodai {\3c&HFF0000&}Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo: \NAihara Yoshikazu:\NOhta Kenjiro:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NNiimi Kaoru:\NKiryu Mikage:\NYamazaki Susumu:\NKato Saburo: \NKato Makoto:\NKato Tsubasa:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:23:00.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1246,154)}Ono Da{\3c&HFF0000&}isuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji\NKokubun Masato\NChiba Yuki\NMugihito\NHisakawa Aya\NNakamura Eriko\NTsuchida Hiroshi\NHosoya Yoshimasa \NSato Rina\NTakamori Natsumi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:06.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1260,614)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Saito Hajime:\NHijikata Ryu:\NYamanami Osamu:\NSerizawa Kotetsu\NTodo Saki:\NKatsuragi Touko:\NAbelt Desler:\NKlaus Keyman:\NGharder Talan:\NLoren Barrel:\NHeidom Gimley:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:06.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1300,174)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Tochi Hiroki \NIshizuka Unsho\NEbara Masashi\NGenda Tessho\NTakagaki Ayahi\NKaida Yuko\NYamadera Koichi\NKamioya Hiroshi\NNakamura Kotaro\NTerasoma Masaki\NMorita Junpei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:11.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST3,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1224,654)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Zorder:\NGailane: \NBalsey:\NMill:\NVilho:\NFactory Manger:\NNol (child):\NAndromeda XO:\NAndromeda Comm Man:\NAndromeda Air Controller:\NDreadnaugut Crewman:\NPresident:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:11.28,Karaoke Translation op,CAST3,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1250,174)}{\3c&HFF0000&}Tezuka Hideaki\NShibata Hidekatsu\NNishimura Tomomichi \NUchiyama Koki\NTasaka Hiroki \NKikumoto Taira\NTakebuchi Akira\NIchinose Hiroaki\NFujinuma Kento\NKamijo Tatsuya\NMatsumoto Shinobu\NMikimoto Yuji
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sotto oyasuminasai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}A gentle goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Osanago no youna toiki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}You breathe like a little child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsumademo soba ni iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll be by your side forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Mabuta tojite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}So close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hidamari no takeru youna yasashisa de...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}As gentle as warm sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Tsusumi komu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}...I'll embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Shiawase umidasu chikara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}The power to bring happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Fuwari fuwari fuwa fuwa yume no naka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Drifting and floating, feeling like I'm having a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Omoi haseru yorisoinagara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Cuddling up and thinking of you from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsudemo waratte ite hoshii to negau
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My wish is for you to keep on smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ubu na egao tayasanu youni
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Never let your childlike smile disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itooshii hito yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My dearest{loved} one...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:21.38,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:21.69,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.10,0:25:24.44,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Destroy the Gatlantis stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:25.27,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.27,0:25:26.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,How're we supposed to fight that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.46,0:25:27.65,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.65,0:25:32.05,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Only parental love can save a child from dying.
